A_049 - A technique that can be useful for you to unblock yourself and regenerate body and mind is to go to a grove and use your senses to explore it calmly: watch the light through the leaves, touch the bark, listen to the sounds, breathe in the smells of the undergrowth. In general, the ideal day to use it is Saturday morning, so you can take advantage of the time until Monday morning to recover and not have work interruptions.